                                                "text": "this genuinely shocked me omfg his aura is insane 😭"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e6ac7ae-f27a-4e66-a990-42d828407e7d",
                                                "sense_id": "179b5431-a40c-3493-a5e9-69efb8a018a8",
                                                "text": "My fav aura losses are rm exposing Taehyun Infront^([sic]) of jongkook, Yeonjun hugging the air while coi leray was hugging Beomgyu, huening doing that one dance in front of the ladies and everyone at the GDA(correct me if I'm wrong)lol"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abaa9853-922f-4273-a02d-dfbaf3650a3c",
                                                "sense_id": "179b5431-a40c-3493-a5e9-69efb8a018a8",
                                                "text": "A clip of Kim stoically shooting at a competition in May spread exponentially online after her Olympic appearance, with posts citing her “aura,” current slang for an aspirational level of cool."
                                            }
                                        ]
